	(text "iCE40 and MCU signals on the left, 33 Ω at the header on every line the probe can drive (_J: header\nside). I²C4, reset (open drain) and presence go straight, with their pull-ups. ESD on all 27 lines.\nPinout: hardware/connectors.csv. +3V3_OUT and +5V_OUT: shield power sheet."
